====Usage notes====
* Usually not capitalized in Russian in the sense of [[idol]], or when referring to a single god with a polytheistic pantheon. It is normally capitalized in monotheistic sense, such as in Christian or Islamic discourse (see {{m|ru|Бог|tr=Box}}), except for some common set expressions.<ref>{{cite-book|ru|author=[[:ru:Розенталь, Дитмар Эльяшевич|Д. Э. Розенталь]]|author2=Е. В. Джанджакова|chapter=III. Употребление прописных букв, §21|chapterurl=http://www.evartist.narod.ru/text1/24.htm|title=Справочник по правописанию, произношению, литературному редактированию|year=1999|location=Moscow|publisher=ЧеРо}}</ref>

